title: 'av-store: prune the unfinalized index when the finalized number is BlockNumber::MAX'
doc:
  - audience: Node Dev
    description: |
      Finalizing BlockNumber::MAX no longer overflows when computing the unfinalized-index
      range or the next batch, and prunes every unfinalized entry, both in the database and in
      the in-memory set of known unfinalized blocks.
crates:
  - name: polkadot-node-core-av-store
    bump: patch
